  message: "Fix deployed by Phase 6 PR1 (commit dbaacdbb84). stable_id_format sub-check in id_format validator class pins canonical sha256:<16hex> shape. Migrated make_route_stable_id, make_entry_stable_id to canonical form; new make_protocol_stable_id factory for 4 protocol linkers (database_query, message_queue, event_sourcing, graphql_resolver). Self-analysis at 0 id_format violations on Symbol.stable_id. Needs bakeoff validation."  # 7a51
